1
00:00:01,633 --> 00:00:02,366
I'm Fu Chenzhou

2
00:00:02,366 --> 00:00:02,866
Mr Fu

3
00:00:02,866 --> 00:00:04,666
Old items and scars are just clues

4
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:06,800
It's up to you whether to verify them

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,500
I'm willing

6
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:09,166
You can check the results yourself when they come out

7
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:10,366
Of course the Fu family will keep it confidential

8
00:00:10,366 --> 00:00:11,900
And don't drag him into irrelevant speculation

9
00:00:11,966 --> 00:00:12,766
I understand

10
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,233
In my past life his background was like

11
00:00:15,233 --> 00:00:16,633
