12
00:00:17,033 --> 00:00:18,833
In this life he will

13
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:20,100
read every document himself

14
00:00:20,233 --> 00:00:21,566
and sign his choice personally

15
00:00:22,833 --> 00:00:24,466
Verification takes at least three days

16
00:00:24,566 --> 00:00:25,666
Once there is progress I'll

17
00:00:25,666 --> 00:00:26,900
