18
00:00:27,066 --> 00:00:27,866
Thank you

19
00:00:32,766 --> 00:00:34,266
Why didn't you just say it was you

20
00:00:36,033 --> 00:00:38,266
Because I didn't want you to choose me out of gratitude

21
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:40,400
Nor do I want you to feel that since I'm your

22
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:42,200
wife now you have to trust me

23
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:43,700
Fu Chenzhou

24
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,900
You can check the hospital archives yourself

25
00:00:46,966 --> 00:00:48,200
Check the orphanage records

26
00:00:48,266 --> 00:00:50,166
Find out who this pendant really belongs to

27
00:00:50,266 --> 00:00:51,233
After you look into it

28
00:00:51,400 --> 00:00:53,566
you can decide for yourself what to believe

29
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:54,266
Su Mengyao

30
00:00:54,266 --> 00:00:56,400
Acting like this only makes me want to trust you more
